  +'<div class="lane sim"><h3>DEMO RF today</h3><p><b>Stake rounds.</b> '+S.amount+' DEMO RF to enter, from a wallet that refills to '+S.allowance+' a day.</p><p><b>Free rounds.</b> A 20,000 DEMO RF sponsor pool pays 1,000 to each round\'s verified winner.</p><p><b>DEMO studio.</b> Play-money versions of the shop items.</p></div>'
  +'<div class="lane future"><h3>Designed, not built</h3><p><b>Real-RF stake escrow.</b> One Friend, one entry. '+S.winnerPct+'% to the winning Friend\'s token-bound wallet and '+S.burnPct+'% to 0x…dEaD in the same transaction.</p></div></div>'
  +'<p class="econkey"><span class="k live">Solid: live on Robinhood Chain</span><span class="k sim">Dashed: DEMO RF</span><span class="k future">Dotted: designed only</span></p></section>'
