 const toolHints={wall:'Click any cell to build solid wall. On a thin row between floors it closes the hatch.',floor:'Click a wall to clear it back to open floor.',ladder:'Click a thin row between two floors to open a ladder hatch.',S:'Moves the entrance to the clicked floor cell.',E:'Moves the exit to the clicked floor cell.',T:'Moves the trophy to the clicked floor cell.',o:'Optional intel dossier to collect.',a:'Keycard A. Opens door A.',b:'Keycard B. Opens door B.',A:'Door A. Needs card A.',B:'Door B. Needs card B.','1':'Floor switch 1. Stepping on it flips circuit 1.','2':'Floor switch 2. Stepping on it flips circuit 2.',D:'Power door. Needs circuit 1.',R:'Exit relay door. Needs circuit 1 and the trophy.',C:'Crate. Pushed, never pulled; can hold a plate down.',p:'Plate 1. Keeps grid 1 open while weighed down.',P:'Plate 2. Keeps grid 2 open while weighed down.',G:'Grid 1. Open while plate 1 is held.',H:'Grid 2. Open while plate 2 is held.',v:'Vent. Two vents connect; the thief uses E.',l:'Light switch the thief can use with L.',laser:'Laser on an empty floor cell away from ladders. Set facing, cycle and offset below.',camera:'Camera on an empty floor cell away from ladders. Set facing below.',drone:'Drone: click both ends of its patrol on one floor, 2 to 12 cells apart. EMP and its circuit blind it.',walker:'Guard: a person walking one floor, seeing 3 cells ahead (1 in the dark). EMP does not stop him; a ladder hatch hides you. Click both ends, 2 to 12 cells apart.',erase:'Click a device or a patrol cell to remove it.'};
