 // LAST HEIST OBSTACLE EDITOR. The three pieces the round rules allow (LastHeist.mutationLevel: wall, laser, camera),
 // each with a pixel icon, a one-line meaning and how many are left this round. Drag one onto the vault (a ghost shows
 // where it lands and every cell that accepts it) or tap it, then tap a cell. Every placement runs three checks:
 // 1. the cell is allowed, 2. the last winning route breaks (the existing rule), 3. HeistSolver, in 10 ms slices,
